OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FUS negotiator and President Donald
OL,8,FTrump's son-in-law Jared Kushner held
OL,9,Fa rare meeting with the Hamas chief on
OL,10,FSunday in a new diplomatic effort to
OL,11,Fmake progress in the stalled Gaza
OL,12,Fceasefire.
OL,14,FKushner will meet on Monday with
OL,15,FIsrael's prime minister, who is under
OL,16,Fpressure after rejecting the new 15-
OL,17,Fpoint, US-backed road map.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G1/6
