CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FThe talks aim to salvage the plan for
OL,8,FHamas to disarm and Israel to withdraw
OL,9,Ffrom the Palestinian territory
OL,10,Fshattered by war.
OL,12,FAt stake are the lives of the two
OL,13,Fmillion people in Gaza and the
OL,14,Freconstruction of the crowded enclave
OL,15,Fnow largely controlled by Israeli
OL,16,Fforces, more than 10 months since the
OL,17,Fceasefire ended major military
OL,18,Foperations.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G2/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
