PN,30603
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FA meeting between Kushner, fellow
OL,8,Fenvoy Steve Witkoff and Hamas leaders
OL,9,Fin Egypt last year helped clinch the
OL,10,Fceasefire, whose progress until now
OL,11,Fhad been stalled over the key issue of
OL,12,FHamas' disarmament.
OL,14,FThe more than two-hour meeting in
OL,15,FEgypt with Hamas' Khalil al-Hayya was
OL,16,Fconfirmed by a regional official and a
OL,17,FHamas official, both speaking to the
OL,18,FAssociated Press on condition of
OL,19,Fanonymity because they were not
OL,20,Fauthorised to talk to reporters.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G3/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
