PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FSubscribe for free to our weekly
OL,8,Fnewsletter for exclusive and original
OL,9,Fcoverage from ITV News. Direct to your
OL,10,Finbox every Friday morning.
OL,12,FKushner was one of a trio of envoys
OL,13,Fmeeting with al-Hayya, with officials
OL,14,Ffrom mediating countries Egypt, Qatar
OL,15,Fand Turkey also there.
OL,17,FHamas in a statement later called on
OL,18,Fmediators and the US-created Board of
OL,19,FPeace overseeing the ceasefire to
OL,20,F"compel" Israel to approve the road
OL,21,Fmap for next steps.
