PN,30605
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FIsraeli Prime Minister Benjamin
OL,8,FNetanyahu last week rejected the 15-
OL,9,Fpoint plan in a rare public show of
OL,10,Fdefiance against the Trump
OL,11,Fadministration, Israel's closest ally.
OL,13,FKushner, Tony Blair and the Board of
OL,14,FPeace director, Nickolay Mladenov, are
OL,15,Fto meet with Netanyahu on Monday,
OL,16,Faccording to a source familiar with
OL,17,Fthe plans and a diplomatic source.
OL,1,W~k4~sj5j5~s1G                    G5/6
OL,2,W/*%+,"-/.!,.!T,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
