PN,30606
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F306A1786970910
OL,3,CTrump son-in-law Kushner holds rare
OL,4,Cmeeting with Hamas to keep ceasefire
OL,5,Calive
OL,7,FSeveral regional powers, including
OL,8,FSaudi Arabia and the United Arab
OL,9,FEmirates, issued a statement
OL,10,Fcondemning Israel's rejection of the
OL,11,Froad map, saying that "Israel now
OL,12,Fbears responsibility for obstructing
OL,13,Fthe efforts to bring peace in Gaza."
OL,14,FOther signers included Jordan,
OL,15,FPakistan, Indonesia and the ceasefire
OL,16,Fmediators.
